%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S14_X1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: How dare they talk so casually about my mentor, the person they murdered
      ruthlessly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You claim to want to go the peaceful way, but was it not you who caused
      a lot of pain by killing the Sustainer of the dimensional Principles? You killed
      her! You're all murderers!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I never knew her personally, but maybe we are still somehow connected in
      another way, seeing how emotional I get when she's being disrespected.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: True, we did dispose of her quite violently. But you must understand, sacrifices
      for the greater good are inevitable.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My blood starts to boil at this point.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Shut your mouth! Who do you think you are that you get to decide what the
      greater good is?!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: After a little pause the Spirit answers calmly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c682d54ecf993f94e8171edb5751f2b1, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6688f352637f4a7f935c13cebba1091e, type: 2}
